 ## Module Reference
 
 - **`load_production_config()`** — loads `config/production.yaml`, returns dict.
-- **`validate_production_config(config)`** — fail-closed validation of all model entries.
-- **`get_production_models(config)`** — returns all 16 sport/market entries keyed by `"sport/market"`.
+- **`validate_production_config(config)`** — fail-closed validation of all 23 sport/market entries.
+- **`get_production_models(config)`** — returns all entries keyed by `"sport/market"`.
 - **`get_production_model(config, sport, market=None)`** — returns a single model dict.
 - **`get_supported_markets(config, sport)`** — returns list of market names for a sport.
 - **`health_check_model(config, sport, market=None)`** — per-market or per-sport aggregate health.
-- **`health_check_all(config)`** — six-sport aggregate health with nested market status.
+- **`health_check_all(config)`** — 13-sport aggregate health with nested market status.
 - **`health_check(config)`** — legacy compatibility wrapper.
+- **`run_production_health_check(config, ledger=...)`** — health check + persist to SQLite.
 
 All functions live in `src/model_prediction/production_service.py`.
 The old `production_canary.py` is retained as a deprecated compatibility shim.
 
