+- `src/model_prediction/calibration.py` — 4 calibrators, cross-fit comparison
+- `src/model_prediction/production_ledger.py` — append-only SQLite predictions DB
+- `src/model_prediction/dashboard_cache.py` — SQLite mirror of Excel ledgers
+- `config/rebuild.yaml` — active/inactive research scope
